DESCRIPTION:Raise a glass and celebrate Pride in style at Pride Uncorked\,
  Russian River Pride's premier VIP fundraising event featuring special gue
 st Bruce Vilanch!\n\nKnown for his razor-sharp wit\, unforgettable humor\,
  and decades of work writing for Hollywood's biggest stars\, Bruce will jo
 in us for a special appearance\, sharing stories\, insights\, and plenty o
 f laughs from a remarkable career in entertainment and LGBTQ\\+ advocacy.\
 n\nEnjoy outstanding local wine\, delicious bites\, and an intimate gather
 ing of supporters who help make Russian River Pride's programs\, events\, 
 and community grants possible.\n\nWhether you're a fan of Bruce Vilanch\, 
 a lover of great wine\, or simply looking for a fabulous evening out\, Pri
 de Uncorked offers the perfect blend of community\, conversation\, celebra
 tion\, and giving back.\n\n🥂 Local Wine ⭐ Special Guest Bruce Vilanch
  🌈 Community Celebration 💖 Supporting Russian River Pride\n\nJoin us
  for an unforgettable evening where every glass raised helps strengthen an
 d support the LGBTQ\\+ community in the Russian River region.\n\nSeats are
  limited. Reserve yours today! Must be 21\\+ to attend.
