DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T220000
UID:260526pEXCz9nY3EOUbo_uk2iAqg
DESCRIPTION:A high-energy concert experience celebrating 60 years of the s
 ongs that shaped our lives — from Queen to Coldplay\, The Beatles to Tin
 a Turner. Starring powerhouse vocalists Aaron LaVigne\, currently competin
 g on this season of *The Voice* on Team Kelly Clarkson\, and Jenna Rubai
 i of the 50th Anniversary Tour of *Jesus Christ Superstar*\, this intimat
 e yet electrifying evening blends nostalgia with showmanship. Expect to la
 ugh\, cry\, sing along\, and feel deeply connected as Aaron and Jenna revi
 sit the music that defined generations. Their vocal fireworks make every f
 amiliar song feel like you’re hearing it for the first time. It’s the 
 soundtrack of your life — performed live under the stars.
LOCATION:Sonoma Field of Dreams
URL:https://transcendencetheatre.org/whats-on/radio-recall/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Revolutionary Love is the Call of our Times
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T210000
UID:260519bv1CRbPkTEay-J09rwvGKw
DESCRIPTION:with Valarie Kaur and Sonny Singh\n\nJoin social justice leade
 r\, author\, and spiritual visionary Valarie Kaur and acclaimed musician S
 onny Singh on a journey into ancestral wisdom through music and meditation
 . Together\, we’ll sit with the question: Who do I want to be in this mo
 ment in history? We’ll unlock the wisdom within\, build sovereign space\
 , and imagine a future of liberation.\n\nImmerse yourself in the stories a
 nd song-prayers of their Sikh ancestors who called us to become sant-sipah
 i — sage warriors. The sage sees through the eyes of love\; the warrior 
 puts that love into action. What does the call to love look like today?
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/revolutionary-love-is-
 the-call-of-our-times-vk1e26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
