UID:251222CAxWm84KQUuvTfSQs3miMw
DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\n**F
 eaturing Smoke & Mirrors & Lila’s Streetside Eats**\n\nJoin us for a liv
 ely Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in do
 wntown Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and bold s
 treet-style food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the energetic\, crow
 d-pleasing sounds of Smoke & Mirrors with the flavorful dishes of Lila’s
  Streetside Eats.\n\nSmoke & Mirrors brings an upbeat mix of familiar favo
 rites that sets the tone for a relaxed and social evening surrounded by ba
 rrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines by the glass or 
 bottle while Lila’s Streetside Eats serves fresh\, creative street food 
 made to order and packed with flavor.\n\nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free
  entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 event inside the Barrel Room. Un
 der-21 guests and leashed pets are welcome on the patio only.\n\nCome grab
  a seat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma County night of great music\, gre
 at wine\, and great food.\n\nWine available for purchase Live music by Smo
 ke & Mirrors Food by Lila’s Streetside Eats (street-style comfort food) 
 Location: Longboard Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healds
 burg\, CA 95448
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
