DESCRIPTION:Celebrate creativity\, community\, and Sonoma's vibrant arts s
 cene at Art on the Plaza 2026. Set in the heart of Sonoma Plaza\, this one
 -day festival brings together local and regional artists\, musicians\, mak
 ers\, and food vendors for a day of inspiration and connection. This year'
 s theme\, The Art of Truth and Beauty\, highlights the power of artistic e
 xpression through painting\, sculpture\, ceramics\, jewelry\, photography\
 , textiles\, and handcrafted goods. Guests can enjoy live music performanc
 es throughout the day\, browse unique artwork\, savor local food and bever
 ages\, and experience the welcoming spirit of Sonoma. Perfect for families
 \, collectors\, visitors\, and locals\, the festival offers an opportunity
  to discover emerging talent\, support small businesses\, and celebrate th
 e creativity that brings communities together. Enjoy a memorable summer da
 y filled with art\, music\, food\, and culture in one of Sonoma's most ico
 nic settings.
