DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered what happens after wastewater leaves yo
 ur home? On Saturday\, July 11\, the Vallejo Flood & Wastewater District i
 nvites you to Behind the Flush\, a special behind‑the‑scenes tour of o
 ur wastewater treatment plant. This is a rare opportunity to see how we sa
 fely clean\, treat\, and return our community's water to the environment.
  \n\nCome join us at this FREE Family-friendly event on Saturday\, July 
 11\, 2026 -- 11am to 2pm. We have fun for the whole family! Face painting\
 , kids' activities\, an ice cream truck\, and popcorn. Meet the dedicated 
 staff\, experience hands-on learning\, and see our equipment\, system\, an
 d infrastructure that keep Vallejo's systems running. \n\nParking is avai
 lable at 450 Ryder Street.\n\nBe sure to pre‑register on Eventbrite for 
 a chance to receive special prizes.\n\n Follow @VallejoWastewater on Face
 book and Instagram for updates!
