DESCRIPTION:The Cities of Cotati and Rohnert Park will be hosting the next
  Eco-Wise Workshop on July 11 from 10-12 at the Rohnert-Park Cotati Librar
 y. Maximize your home's energy efficiency with new appliances\, weatheriza
 tion\, going all-electric\, and more! In this workshop you'll learn about 
 your options for energy upgrades\, rebates to save you money\, water savin
 g tips\, and watch a demonstration of an induction cooktop. Free swag and 
 snacks will be given to all participants.
LOCATION:Rohnert Park-Cotati Library
URL:https://www.cotaticity.gov/1690/Eco-Wise-Workshop-Series-2026
