BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Valley of the Moon Music Festival Concert 1: Bohemian Homeland
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T180000
UID:26060249Ymlm0GN0-rxrNsz_BlPA
DESCRIPTION:Kick off the 12th season of Valley of the Moon Music Festival 
 with a vibrant evening celebrating the musical world of Smetana and Dvoř
 ák. This program explores the extraordinary friendship between the two Cz
 ech composers\, whose shared roots in the folk traditions of their Czech h
 omeland shaped some of the 19th century’s most distinctive chamber music
 . Stay after the performance for a glass of wine and sweeping Sonoma Valle
 y views. Arrive early for a free pre-concert lecture led by musicologist K
 ate van Orden. Concert duration: approximately 2 hours with intermission.\
 n\nThe Valley of the Moon Music Festival returns July 11–26\, 2026\, wit
 h Postcards from Dvořák\, a season inspired by the travels\, influences\
 , and cultural connections behind the composer’s music. Set in the heart
  of Sonoma Valley\, the festival brings together internationally acclaimed
  musicians for historically informed performances that blend world-class c
 lassical music with the beauty and charm of wine country.
LOCATION:Hanna Center Auditorium 
URL:https://valleyofthemoonmusicfestival.org/event/bohemian-homeland/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
