 , 29\, June 5\, June 12\, June 19\, June 26\n\nJazz Days: May 24\, June 2
 1\, and July 12\n\nLavender U-Cut Experience: June 27-28\, July 4-5\, Jul
 y 11. Note: July 12 is also a U-Cut day\, but is listed under Jazz Days.\n
 \nThe farm grounds are open from 10 AM to 4 PM\, and the band will play fr
