DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260712T230000
UID:260519dGOoUeHCnkeQg8hqRrFW2g
DESCRIPTION:Acclaimed trumpeter\, composer\, and American cultural ambassa
 dor Wynton Marsalis headlines Festival Napa Valley's Arts for All Gala\, 
 one of the nation's premier fundraisers for education and the arts. Guests
  will also enjoy an artfully composed multi-course dinner by Chef Dustin 
 Valette\, chef-owner of Valette and The Matheson in Healdsburg\, each cour
 se paired with exceptional wines from Nickel & Nickel\, part of Far Niente
  Wine Estates. Celebrity auctioneer Lydia Fenet leads the signature live 
 auction of once-in-a-lifetime travel adventures\, bespoke performing arts 
 experiences\, highly collectible wines\, and more.\n\nProxy bidding and 
 Fund a Need are available for those unable to attend.
LOCATION:Nickel & Nickel
