DESCRIPTION:Bring your instrument\, bring your friends\, and settle in for
  a night of live jazz at the Empress Marquee Club. Monday Jazz Jam is a we
 lcoming\, musician-friendly evening where players can sit in\, listeners c
 an enjoy a relaxed club atmosphere\, and the music moves naturally from sw
 inging standards to blues\, ballads\, Latin grooves\, and spontaneous impr
 ovisation.\n\nThis Week’s House Band\n\nJesse Levitt — saxophones\n\nB
 rian Juarez — bass\n\nBen Flint — piano\n\nErik von Buchau — drums a
 nd vibes\n\nTogether\, they’ll anchor the night with taste\, experience\
 , and musical flexibility\, giving guest musicians a strong foundation to 
 step up and join the jam. Whether you’re a horn player\, vocalist\, guit
 arist\, percussionist\, bassist\, pianist\, or simply a jazz lover\, this 
 is a night built around community\, creativity\, and live interaction.\n\n
 Musicians play free and get dinner\, making this one of Vallejo’s most i
 nviting weekly gatherings for working players\, students\, seasoned improv
 isers\, and music fans alike.\n\nThe jam runs from 7 PM to 10 PM\, with do
 ors and dinner beginning at 6 PM.
LOCATION:Empress Marquee Club
