UID:260603S8I5XdmaEU6j4PLGA6mdhg
DESCRIPTION:Our weekly summer concerts in the Healdsburg Plaza from 6:00 p
 .m. to 8:00 p.m. provide an eclectic and unique line-up of bands\, and hav
 e been assembled to please a wide array of musical interests. Food vendors
  will be on-hand to offer locally sourced food for sale starting at 5:00 p
 .m. with the music beginning at 6:00 p.m.\n\nAbout the band: Dustin Saylor
  and The Stowaways are known for their engaging performances that blend co
 untry rock with soulful melodies. Their live shows are a testament to Sayl
 or's dedication to his craft\, as he brings a warm and powerful voice to t
 he stage. The band's music is a reflection of Saylor's personal experience
