DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260714T100000
UID:260508ssURvJt9aE2NGvnXQencVw
DESCRIPTION:The Parks Foundation is teaming up with the American Canyon So
 roptimists for a monthly slow stroll series at Wetlands Edge trail. Join u
 s for a leisurely paced walk on the first Tuesday of the month at 10:00 am
 . The pace will be casual for this social walk focused on meeting neighbor
 s & enjoying a little outdoor time. Wear light layers & walking shoes. The
  stroll will last approximately one-hour along the flat\, packed gravel we
 tlands trail. Participants should meet at the trailhead near the trail inf
 ormation kiosk. All are welcome.
LOCATION:Wetlands Edge Park
URL:https://www.acparks.org/events/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
