 thusiasm! Whether you’re a longtime chorister or simply love to sing\, j
 oin us for music\, community\, and the magic of midsummer evenings shared 
 in song.\n\nPenngrove Clubhouse\n\n385 Woodward Ave.\, Penngrove\n\n $15
  per session | $40 for all 3\n\nJuly 15 – Bob Worth: Highlights from Bac
 h’s Mass in B Minor \n\nJuly 22 – Amanda McFadden: American Spiritua
 ls \n\nJuly 29 – Magen Solomon: Bach’s Mass in G\, Jesu meine Freude
  & Cantata 131\n\nAll scores provided!
