BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Comedy of Cliff Cash
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T213000
UID:260709pRV0xbnjHEycJWASFOiecw
DESCRIPTION:Cliff tackles everything from racism to homophobia\, from gree
 d and war to death and dicorce saying \, "I believe it is our duty as comi
 cs to shine the light of levity into the dark corners of the human experie
 nce\, and by doing so we can take power away from the thngs that sadden or
  scare us.  Maybe that old saying about laughter being the best medicine r
 eally is true. I hope so because I don't have health insurance."\n\nCliff 
 Cash got his comedy start in Wilmington\, NC at Nutt St. Comedy\, now Dead
  Crow Comedy Room.  In the years since\, has has gone on to win Port city'
 s Top Comic\, Comedy Zones' almost famous\, and Bes of the Fest at SLO Com
 edy Festival\, and he has been a finalist n Comedy Central's UpNext and St
 andup NBV.  He's played iconic rooms from the Comedy Store n LA to the Com
 edy Cellar in New York City.  He's also headlines festivals like Altercati
 on Comedy Festival in Austin and Tree Fort Festival in Boise.  Cliff has b
 een featured on Sirius XM Comedy Central\, Rawdog\, Laughs TV\, Roftop Com
 edy\, and has a half-hour special from Dry Bar.  His 2021 debut album Half
 way There \\(released through StandUp! Records\\) spent a week at number o
 ne on iTunes. \n\nThis is a fundraiser for Sebastiani Theatre and Wake UP 
 Sonoma\n\nDoors open at 7:00.
LOCATION:Sebastiani Theatre
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/the-comedy-of-cliff-cash?a
 ff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
