SUMMARY:Tom Rhodes At McNear's in the Red Bull Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T230000
UID:260611tUPZV3yilk6UEGbt06OO8A
DESCRIPTION:**Tom Rhodes Live in Petaluma –** Thursday\, Jul 16\, 2026 @
  8:00 PM PDT\n\nJoin us for an unforgettable night of stand-up with world-
 traveling comedy icon **Tom Rhodes**\, performing live at **McNear’s S
 aloon’s Red Bull Room** in **Petaluma**.\n\nWith a career spanning dec
 ades\, Tom has done it all — from being one of Comedy Central’s first 
 breakthrough stars to hosting his own talk show in Amsterdam\, and perform
 ing on Netflix\, Comedy Central\, and stages across the globe. His smart\,
  soulful\, and razor-sharp comedy has made him a favorite among comedy lov
 ers worldwide.\n\nThis is your chance to catch a true legend in an intimat
 e setting — one night only!\n\nWe think standup comedy should be a cool 
 thing that people come and enjoy\, not some cookie cutter corporate shack 
 with no love of the art.​We are making Standup comedy cool again by prod
 ucing the highest quality comedy showcases featuring comedians from Netfli
 x\, Hulu\, Comedy Central\, HBO and more.​Grindhouse Comedy is the futur
 e Grindhouse Comedy is cool. Come see one of our Standup comedy shows in S
 acramento\, Hayward or Petaluma.
LOCATION:McNear's Red Bull Room
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/tom-rhodes/694607?afflky=MysticTheatre
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
