SUMMARY:21+ Latin Summer Fest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T020000
UID:260709JPm3YkQjuEuSXbfmzbnT2w
DESCRIPTION:DATE: FRIDAY JULY 17TH\n\nTIME: 10:00PM-2:00AM\n\nDOORS OPEN: 
 9:30PM\n\nNO ENTRY AFTER 11:30PM\n\nAGES 21\\+. VALID IDS REQUIRED.\n\nGet
  ready for a night full of music\, dancing\, and Latin vibes. Latin Summer
  Fest is taking over Victory House and Chuck’s Bowling!\n\nWe’ve got a
  stacked lineup with three DJs and two live bandas that will keep the part
 y going all night long across three different dance floors.\n\nFEATURING\n
 \n🎧 DJ Willie — Mixing Banda Rave Music\n\n🎧 DJ Brxndo & DJ C-Los 
 — Mixing Reggaeton\, Cumbia\, Merengue\, & Latin Hits\n\n🎺 Special Gu
 est Banda Ultimo Comando\n\n🎺 Headliner Banda Nueva Generacion\n\nVenue
  Highlights:\n\nVictory House offers a full bar\, including an impressive 
 selection of 24 taps. A late-night food menu will be available. During our
  live events\, our restaurant turns into the biggest dance floor in Santa 
 Rosa. \n\nChuck’s Bowling features 16 lanes\, two more dance floors\, a
 nd another full bar to keep the drinks flowing. Enjoy discounted 5 frame b
 owling games throughout the night!\n\nTicket Information: General Admissio
 n: $30\n\nLimited tickets available – only 500!  If we sell out ahead o
 f time\, no tickets will be available at the door.\n\nBottle Service Infor
 mation: With the purchase of a bottle\, you receive a VIP table and two mi
 xers of your choice. Inquire about bottle service at the door.\n\nIMPORTAN
 T EVENT POLICIES:\n\n\\*Valid ID's Required In order to consume alcoholic 
 beverages\, you must establish that you are at least 21 years of age.\n\nW
 e accept the following Identification for the purchase of alcohol per Alco
 hol Beverage Control standards:\n\n- State issued driver license.\n\n- Sta
 te Issued Identification card.\n\n- Passport or passport card.\n\n- Milita
 ry ID.\n\nLegally acceptable identification is one card that contains thes
 e six characteristics:\n\n- Issued by a U.S. government agency \\(federal\
 , state\, county\, or city\\)\n\n- Name of the person\n\n- Date of birth\n
 \n- Photograph\n\n- Physical description \\(height\, weight\, hair\, and e
 ye color\\)\n\n- Currently valid \\(not expired\\)\n\nWe do not accept the
  following forms of identification for the purchase of alcohol:\n\n- Forei
 gn driver license/identification card\n\n- U.S. Government Immigrant ident
 ification card\n\n- Birth Certificate\n\n- School or work identification c
 ard\n\n- Identification issued by a non-government agency\n\n- Social Secu
 rity card\n\n- Interim or temporary driver license or receipt for license 
 from DMV\n\n- Check cashing card\n\n- Otherwise valid document that is exp
 ired\, damaged\, altered\, borrowed\, stolen\, counterfeit\, or forged\n\n
 \\*No bags allowed. Small handbags are allowed but are subjected to search
 .\n\n\\*No smoking on the premises\, including vaporizers and electronic c
 igarettes.\n\n\\*No loitering. Loitering on theses premises or in the adj
 acent parking areas is strictly prohibited. If you are caught drinking in 
 the parking lot you will be asked to leave the premises.\n\n\\*No in-and-o
 uts. Once you leave the event you may not re-enter. This prevents unwanted
  activity from happening in our parking lots.\n\n\\*No outside food and be
 verage is allowed inside of Poppy Bank Epicenter. \n\nVictory House\n\n32
 15 Coffey Ln\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95403\n\ninfo@visitepicenter.com
LOCATION:Victory House
URL:https://www.sevenrooms.com/events/victoryhouse/evnnt
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
