BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kalei Yamanoha & The Sam Chase Trio
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T193000
UID:260628a1m7elhNWUuQGEEtlABNqw
DESCRIPTION:$25 General Admission\n\nDoors at 7:30pm.\n\nShow from 8:15-10
 :30pm with one intermission\n\nEarlybirds!\n\n$3 off each ticket when you 
 use the code earlybird2 at checkout. Offer ends July 12th.\n\nPromo Co
 des are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitive\, bu
 t must be typed as one word.\n\nKalei Yamanoha has been a musical explore
 r since childhood\, learning traditional Hawaiian music with his father an
 d expanding to play in dozens of projects across the United States and bey
 ond. A multi-instrumentalist equally at home on guitar\, accordion\, banjo
 \, steel guitar\, brass and more\, Kalei deploys his broad musical vocabul
 ary in service of songs that grow from tradition\, travel\, and curiosity.
  Over years of touring\, collaborating\, recording\, and teaching\, he’s
  developed a sound that feels rooted yet fluid\, honoring Hawai’i while 
 welcoming influences from around the world.\n\nwww.kaleiyamanoha.com\n\nht
 tps://www.instagram.com/kaleiyamanohamusic\n\nTHE SAM CHASE TRIO\, also kn
 own as “The God Particle Of Music\,” by all who have hypothesized of h
 is existence before his discovery 10 years ago\, eminent singer-songwriter
  The Sam Chase strides out of the hadron collider flanked on one side by C
 handra Johnson\, violin heroine\, and on the other by Devon McClive\, reno
 wned and feared cellist at large.   Their songs matter to the masses in t
 he same way that the Higgs boson gives mass to all matter.  Their music i
 s the Big Bang to a universe of sound.\n\nSome say that their music has th
 e potential to destroy the universe\, but it is a risk that we should be w
 illing to take. This is what you get when deftly bowed strings collide wit
 h ironclad songwriting. This is the pure distillation of adventure and hea
 rtache of American song.  https://thesamchase.com/ https://www.instagram.
 com/thesamchase/ https://www.instagram.com/chanjohnson/ https://www.instag
 ram.com/devonmcclive/
LOCATION:The Lost Church Santa Rosa
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket#/instances/a0FUh0
 00007tTIHMA2
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
