BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cosmos and Coco
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T230000
UID:260514FhtSXDQQXEu9XvmsJPw8sA
DESCRIPTION:Begin your evening with a guided hike along our Planet Walk Tr
 ail\, a flat and scenic journey to Saturn and back\, approximately 1.2 mil
 es in total\, beneath the darkening sky as knowledgeable docents offer ins
 ightful facts at each planetary stop. Did you know: each step in our plane
 t walk is equivalent to 2.3 million miles through our solar system! After
  the walk\, return to the Robert Ferguson Observatory to warm up with a cu
 p of hot cocoa and an in-depth stargazing session led by one of our experi
 enced astronomers. The night sky tour blends science and storytelling\, he
 lping you appreciate the night sky in a whole new way.Once the Star guide 
 portion concludes\, guests are welcome to refill their cocoa and continue 
 observing through our telescopes for the remainder of the night. This pro
 gram is designed for families and guests of all ages who can comfortably e
 njoy a light hike and remain respectful and attentive while volunteers off
 er information. Please wear appropriate footwear and bring a white-light f
 lashlight for this event only.
LOCATION:Robert Ferguson Observatory 
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/cosmos-cocoa-2026-tickets-240974
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
