DESCRIPTION:**Why We Live Here Musics & Arts Fest**\n\nJoin us for the **3
 rd Annual Why We Live Here Music & Arts Fest**\, a celebration of the musi
 c\, creativity\, food\, wine\, and community that make Sonoma County such 
 a special place to call home.\n\nSet among the vineyards at Hook & Ladder 
 Winery\, this annual festival brings together an outstanding lineup of reg
 ional musicians\, local artisans\, food vendors\, and wine lovers for an u
 nforgettable afternoon in the Russian River Valley. Spend the day discover
 ing new artists\, exploring local makers\, enjoying great food\, and shari
 ng a bottle of wine with friends while surrounded by the beauty of wine co
 untry.\n\nThis year’s lineup features a diverse mix of acclaimed singer-
 songwriters\, bands\, and performers whose music perfectly complements a d
 ay spent outdoors.\n\n**Featured Performers**\n\nBenjamin Andrews & The Su
 ccess Ensemble\n\nAnna Ash\n\nJason Beard’s Bring Joy\n\nOona & The Good
  Band\n\n**Food & Extras**\n\nFresh wood-fired pizza from our outdoor oven
 \n\nFeatured food vendors\n\nLocal artists and makers\n\nHook & Ladder win
 es available by the glass and bottle\n\nFamily-friendly atmosphere\n\nLawn
  and picnic seating available *(blankets and chairs encouraged)*\n\n**Admi
 ssion**\n\n**Tickets: $40 GA / $30 Wine Club**\n\nGather your friends\, br
 ing a blanket\, and join us for a day of music\, art\, wine\, and communit
 y as we celebrate everything that makes Sonoma County a place we love to c
 all home.
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
