UID:260529F4OAAgR_oEaenQGyX_5b2Q
DESCRIPTION:Rise & Shine at the Balloon Festival! \n\nLooking for a magic
 al way to start your day? Join us for an unforgettable two-day Balloon Fes
 tival packed with fun for all ages!\n\n 4 AM Glow Show – Watch the sky
  come alive as glowing balloons flicker like fireflies in the early mornin
 g darkness. It’s a breathtaking sight you won’t want to miss!\n\n FRE
 E Kids Zone – After the glow show\, let the little ones run wild with g
 ames and activities designed just for them.\n\n Food & Vendors – Grab 
 delicious bites\, browse unique merchandise\, and soak in the festive atmo
 sphere while we prepare for potential balloon launches. Weather permitting
 .\n\n Tethered Balloon Rides – Weather permitting\, experience the thr
 ill of rising gently above the ground for a one-of-a-kind view!\n\nBring y
 our friends\, bring your family\, and come create unforgettable memories t
 ogether. Start your morning with wonder\, laughter\, and a sky full of col
 or!\n\n Don’t miss out—plan your visit today!
LOCATION:Sonoma County Event Center at the Fairgrounds
URL:https://www.schabc.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
