BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:World Premiere: The Judgment of Paris
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T200000
UID:260516FHDPn3Hs7kWbfnR9khewOQ
DESCRIPTION:Commissioned for Festival Napa Valley's 20th Anniversary Seaso
 n\, The Judgment of Paris is a one-act opera by composer Jake Heggie and
  librettist Gene Scheer\, inspired by the legendary 1976 blind tasting tha
 t transformed the world of wine.\n\nThe production features an exceptional
  cast led by soprano Danielle De Niese\, baritone Quinn Kelsey\, tenor Nic
 holas Phan\, and mezzo-sopranos Simone McIntosh and Brenda Rae. They are j
 oined by the Manetti Shrem Opera Program Fellows and the Festival Orchestr
 a Napa under the baton of Kent Nagano\, with stage direction by Jean-Romai
 n Vesperini.\n\nElevate the experience with The Judgment of Paris Opera T
 asting\, a celebration of Napa Valley wines for $85. Enjoy a pre-performan
 ce glass of Charles Krug and a curated charcuterie box. After the premie
 re\, join a celebratory reception featuring a tasting of wines from Chate
 au Montelena and Stag’s Leap Wine Cellars\, the wineries awarded top h
 onors at the 1976 Judgment of Paris\, along with special selections from 
 Bouchaine Vineyards.
LOCATION:Charles Krug
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/world-premiere-the-judg
 ment-of-paris/18756529/2026-07-18T18
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
