DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T180000
UID:260206Wtcdl8FqS0yzca5JIVe0bA
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come t
 ogether.\n\nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tast
 ing room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acros
 s the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll an
 d Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new soun
 ds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\nPepper On The Run\n\nThe Pepper
  On The Run band is a tribute to the music of Sir Paul McCartney from The
  Beatles\, Wings and early solo songs! Pepper On The Run plays all of his 
 greatest music\, while leaving out the ones that are too schmaltzy \\(No 
 “Silly Love Songs” I “Say Say Say” here\\). One fan calls them\, 
 “Beatles with balls!” They’re based in the San Francisco Bay Area.\n
 \nDetails\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill
  up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family 
 friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/event/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
