UID:260508N3iBSVPMdkyCWBcph1LW8Q
DESCRIPTION:Sample coffee from around the world\, browse crafts and confec
 tions by local vendors\, or enjoy made-to order crêpes while listening to
  live music.\n\nCoffee cupping\, or coffee tasting\, is the practice of ob
 serving the tastes and aromas of brewed coffee. Join us to sample coffees 
 from around the world side-by-side\, develop your palate and discover coff
 ees you LOVE that you never knew existed!
