UID:260706hm82s9MfwE2t9HDn4WiW8A
DESCRIPTION:**LARA LOUISE**’s sultry voice has been heard all over the w
 orld\, her recordings having been streamed over seventy-five million times
  on Spotify and Youtube. Growing up in Holland\, Lara started out as a fol
 k musician before making the transition to jazz and bossa nova. She sings 
 mostly in English and French\, with an emphasis on French Jazz and the cla
 ssic American songbook from the 30s to the 60s. What better way to celebra
 te Bastille Day than with a songstress singing French Jazz?\n\nTogether wi
 th producer and multi-instrumentalist **Gawain Mathews**\, she has record
 ed 2 highly acclaimed jazz albums\, "*Alone Together*" and "*Quiet Nights 
 of Quiet Stars*".\n\n​​NO COVER CHARGE!
LOCATION:Sonoma Mission Inn
