 onal ingredients.\n\nYou’ll learn how different wines\, fruits\, herbs\,
  come together to create perfectly balanced spritzers—then mix and custo
 mize your own as you sip and savor in our beautiful outdoor garden. Whethe
 r you love crisp and citrusy or floral and refreshing\, you’ll leave wit
 h new favorites \\(and new skills\\) to enjoy all summer long. Surrounded 
