DESCRIPTION:FeLine & Movement\n\nDesigned by Women. Defined by Movement.\n
 \nWhere ceramics\, painting\, bead mosaic and mixed media come to life.\n\
 nThree women explore a variety of media-including ceramics\, painting\, an
 d bead mosaic-in this July art exhibit. Featuring enchanting feline-inspir
 ed creatures as a central theme\, the exhibition highlights the unique cre
 ative voices of three friends whose individual styles come together to for
 m a vibrant and captivating show. Come enjoy the show with Artists Lony Ma
 ya Neubauer\, Susan Noll and Rosalyn Parhams.\n\nMare Island Art Studios\,
  110 Pintado St\, Vallejo CA\n\nSundays in July\, noon to 5 p.m.\n\nRecept
 ion: Sunday 12\, noon to 5 p.m.
