DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T170000
UID:260508TbQt1GwuT0yc0bYaruP1JQ
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Music in Place and the City of Sonoma invite you
  to soak up the sunshine\, sip local wine\, and dance to live music at the
  Sonoma Plaza Grinstead Amphitheater during Sonoma Sundays On the Plaza\, 
 a free concert series running June 7 through October 4\, 2026.\n\nThis wee
 k's lineup features Howard Paul and the MIP All Stars! Howard Paul is an a
 cclaimed jazz guitarist and President/CEO of Benedetto Guitars\, a celebra
 ted jazz guitar manufacturing company founded in 1968. Growing up near Atl
 antic City\, NJ\, he’s played guitar since age 4\, and focused exclusive
 ly on jazz since age 10.\n\nSonoma Sundays are free and open to all\, than
 ks to the generous support of the Sonoma Community Center\, The Dawn Redwo
 ods Trust\, and the McNeely Family Foundation.\n\nPack your picnic\, bring
  your dancing shoes\, and meet us on the Plaza!
LOCATION:Grinstead Amphitheater
URL:https://musicinplace.org/event/sonoma-sundays-on-the-plaza-7-19/
