DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260720T160000
UID:26062926s0QXPkmkul8R6NV5JKlQ
DESCRIPTION:Every person experiences an ebb and flow to the tides of their
  creativity. We will share space together to design\, exchange ideas\, and
  hold ourselves accountable to our unique interests! The first portion of 
 our time together will involve a check-in discussion of ‘what is'\, lead
 ing into ‘what could be'. The talk will be facilitated by Erin Partridge
 \, an art therapist with a long history of supporting people in reengaging
  with creativity. After our initial talk\, we will have some time to indiv
 idually focus on our creative practices in the space of the gallery. Befor
 e we close\, we will share anything that came up in the process. Bring you
 r ideas\, a project\, and an interest in creative community. Please be min
 dful of what you choose to show up with-something quiet\, easy to clean up
 \, and non-disruptive to your fellow creatives. Not sure where to begin? S
 ome basic materials are available\, thanks to a donation from  Blick Art M
 aterials . Open for all ages-youth under 12 with an adult chaperone please
 ! Mondays\, 1-4 PM Facilitator: Erin Partridge
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/jumpstart-your-art/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SGA's Got Talent Camp
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260720T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260720T143000
UID:260709FbWpcXNEKk6RMaijlTMxTg
DESCRIPTION:Make the most of summer with award-winning Gymnastics Camps at
  SGA! Keep children’s bodies and brains active with careful guidance fro
 m our trained instructors\, and have some fun\, too. We’ll play in our o
 utdoor inflatable water parks\, eat lunch in the park\, and learn basic gy
 mnastics techniques every day from 8:30 AM - 2:30 PM. Each week has its ow
 n unique theme with specialized crafts\, games\, activities\, and learning
 . Enroll in one week\, a few\, or all ten! Sign up on our site\, email us\
 , or call us to register. Spots are limited.\n\n-This week’s theme is: S
 GA's GOT TALENT-\n\nThis week is all about individuality\, whether your ch
 ild is into singing\, dancing\, gymnastics\, magic\, art\, or hasn’t qui
 te figured it out yet. This week\, we’re helping campers build confidenc
 e and create a talent show act to perform on their final day of camp! Alon
 gside that\, campers get to spend the day playing\, creating obstacle cour
 ses\, making arts and crafts\, and learning some new gymnastics skills!\n\
 nCamps are best suited for children ages 4 to 12. All participants must be
  fully toilet-trained.\n\nStudents should wear a t-shirt with elastic wais
 tband shorts/pants\, or a leotard. Long hair must be pulled back. No jewel
 ry\, jeans\, dresses\, or skirts. Please wear or pack clothing layers for 
 if the weather permits us to adventure outside!\n\nPlease pack your child\
 \(ren\\) a PEANUT-FREE lunch\, water bottle\, and comfortable shoes. Morni
 ng snacks will be provided.
LOCATION:Sonoma Gymnastics Academy
URL:https://sonomagymnasticsacademy.com/camps/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
