UID:2606302tbf562hsESQ1yaltKlrZg
DESCRIPTION:Ready to dance? Join our beginner Marin salsa class where no e
 xperience or partner is needed. Just comfortable shoes and desire to have 
 fun!\n\nGreat for first timers!\n\n• No dance experience required\n\n•
  Non-marking shoes soles\n\n• No partner necessary\n\nOur relaxed enviro
 nment is perfect for learning salsa basics\, as we make it fun and enjoyab
 le. In this class you will learn basic directional steps\, proper frame fo
 r partner-work and simple turn patterns.\n\nWe organize our curriculum so 
 that the movements are easy to remember. Join us to learn the fundamentals
 ! No experience is necessary and no partner is required.\n\nDate & Time:\n
 \n• Mondays @ 7:00 PM – 8:00PM\n\n• Instructor: Lucie Ebnerova\n\n
 • Address: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 
 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/beginner-salsa-monday/
