DESCRIPTION:Join us on the Third Tuesday of the month at 10:00 am as we di
 scuss different books! Print Copies will be available in the branch a mont
 h before the discussion. Please call or email the library with any questio
 ns. Book Club titles and dates are subject to change. For up to date infor
 mation visit: sonomalibrary.org/bookclubs 2026 Schedule January 20 - North
  Woods by Daniel Mason February 17 - The Housemaid by Freida McFadden Marc
 h 17 - Three Bags Full by Leonie Swann April 21 - Maid by Stephanie Land M
 ay 19 - Good Night Irene by Luis Alberto Urrea June 16 - Nightshade by Mic
