UID:260708FxNCJlgdDUST-owe9nihBA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate apple season by joining Gold Ridge Organic Farms' pa
 stry chef Alli Keyser-Marti for a demonstration-style class on making appl
 e rose tarts. You'll learn the key techniques and tricks\, so you can conf
 idently recreate these beautiful pastries at home.\n\nWhat to expect:\n\n\
 \*A hands-on demonstration in our charming Apple Cottage kitchen\n\n\\*Ins
 ider tips on creating delicious apple pastries\\*Tasting of the finished p
 roduct\n\n\\*A scenic ride from our Farm Shop to the Apple Cottage in our 
 apple-themed trolley\n\n\\*10% off all Farm Shop purchases on the day of t
 he workshop\n\nAlli Keyser-Marti worked as a pastry chef trained in Michel
 in-starred restaurants in Sonoma County. Her expertise extends beyond past
 ry to cheese — she's a Certified Cheese Professional® and an ACS Certif
 ied Cheese Sensory Evaluator®. In 2023\, she judged cheese for the Good F
 ood Awards. You'll find her at Gold Ridge Organic Farms pairing cheese\, o
 live oil\, and apples with the same precision she brings to the kitchen.\n
 \nWe do our best to run every class as scheduled. If we don't reach minimu
 m enrollment\, we'll notify you at least 24 hours in advance and offer a f
 ull refund.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/615242/appl
 e-rose-tarts-demo-with-alli-keyser-marti
