DESCRIPTION:Can a Swamp Princess Save the Kingdom?  The Queen decreed: No
  one marries until Prince Dauntless finds a bride. But her impossible test
 s foil every royal match... until Princess Winnifred arrives!\n\n​Starri
 ng SAL Favorites: Daniela Innocenti Beem as Princess Winnifred and Tim Set
 zer as Prince Dauntless\n\n​Join us for a hilarious musical comedy about
  a royal love that’s been waiting a very long time!
