DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\n**F
 eaturing Highway 12 Band & Mamadios Philly**\n\nJoin us for a lively Frida
 y night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in downtown He
 aldsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and classic comfort
  food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the high-energy\, crowd-pleasin
 g sounds of Highway 12 Band with the bold\, satisfying flavors of Mamadios
  Philly.\n\nHighway 12 Band brings a fun mix of danceable hits and familia
 r favorites\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and social eve
 ning surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s w
 ines by the glass or bottle while Mamadios Philly serves their signature P
 hiladelphia-style cheesesteaks and hearty favorites\, made fresh on site.\
 n\nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over
 -21 event inside the Barrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pets are wel
 come on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a classic Sono
 ma County night of great music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\nWine avai
 lable for purchase Live music by Highway 12 Band Food by Mamadios Philly (
 Philadelphia-style cheesesteaks and comfort fare) Location: Longboard Vine
 yards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
