DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T203000
UID:260706NbGhRvPtlUKReF739NOXlw
DESCRIPTION:Step onto the dance floor and spice up your Friday Night! We d
 esigned our Salsa Date Night specifically for couples to connect\, laugh\,
  and learn together.\n\nA beginner-friendly introduction to salsa steps.\n
 \nStrictly NO rotations—you will dance exclusively with your partner all
  night.\n\nA vibrant\, romantic atmosphere to enjoy your partner’s compa
 ny.\n\nWhy You’ll Love Salsa Date Night:\n\nLearn Something New Together
 : Stepping out of your comfort zone as a team is one of the best ways to s
 trengthen your bond. Our expert instructors break down the steps so simply
  that even those with two left feet will be moving with confidence.\n\nQua
 lity Time Together: Between work\, chores\, and daily stressors\, it’s e
 asy to end up just “co-existing” on the couch. This night forces you t
 o log off\, look into each other’s eyes\, laugh through the missteps\, a
 nd truly enjoy each other’s company.\n\nA Vibrant Atmosphere: Great musi
 c\, high energy and fantastic time..\n\nNo prior dance experience needed
 —just bring your partner\, comfortable shoes\, and an open mind.\n\nSpac
 es are limited to ensure plenty of room on the dance floor. Reserve your s
 pot today and give your partner a night to remember!\n\nDATE: EVERY 4th Fr
 iday 7:30 PM\n\nCOST: $50 \\(per couple\\)\n\nADDRESS: 4140 Redwood hwy 8
 \, San Rafael
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/salsa-date-night/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Friday Music/Poetry Open Mic Happy Hour - Downtown Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T190000
UID:260705JcjKZv37TkGk4TFL4GaSZg
DESCRIPTION:Friday Music/Poetry Open Mic Happy Hour\n\nEvery Friday | 5:00
  PM - 7:30 PM\n\nLooking for a music open mic in Santa Rosa? Come spend Ha
 ppy Hour with us every Friday at Barrel Proof Lounge\, where local musicia
 ns\, poets\, songwriters\, and creatives take over the stage.\n\nWhether y
 ou're performing your latest song\, reading a poem\, trying stand-up story
 telling\, or just enjoying the atmosphere\, everyone is welcome.\n\nDon't 
 have an instrument?\n\nWe've got you covered.\n\nUnlike most open mics\, w
 e provide a full backline\, so you can show up and perform without hauling
  your entire setup across town.\n\nAvailable equipment includes:\n\n 3-pi
 ece drum kit\n\n Electric & acoustic guitars\n\n Banjo\n\n Mandolin\n\n
  Professional microphones\n\n Full PA and sound system\n\nJust bring you
 r talent (or your courage) and we'll help with the rest.\n\nPerformance Ti
 mes\n\n Music — up to 10 minutes\n\n Poetry & Spoken Word — 5-7 minu
 tes\n\nOriginal music\, cover songs\, spoken word\, storytelling\, folk\, 
 punk\, indie\, Americana\, blues\, country\, rock\, experimental... if it 
 belongs on a stage\, we want to hear it.\n\nJust Want to Listen?\n\nGrab a
  drink\, relax\, and discover local talent during Happy Hour. Every week b
 rings new performers\, new songs\, and new voices. It's a great way to mee
 t other musicians\, connect with the local arts community\, or simply enjo
 y live entertainment before your Friday night gets started.\n\nEvent Detai
 ls\n\nEvery Friday\n\n5:00 PM - 7:30 PM\n\nFREE Admission\n\n1-2 Drink Min
 imum\n\n21+\n\nBarrel Proof Lounge\n\nDowntown Santa Rosa\n\nRespect the s
 pace.\n\nSupport local artists.\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com**
  for all sorts of good times ahead!\n\nSupport your local venue.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/friday-musicpoetry-open-mic-happy-hour-do
 wntown-santa-rosa-tickets-1992946500632?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Collectors Lunch Pairing at Lynmar Estate
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T143000
UID:260626Oo_UAC5QoUqmF2HsnKkZAg
DESCRIPTION:Rooted in the bounty of Quail Hill Vineyard\, Lynmar Estate’
 s Summer Collectors Lunch Pairing invites guests to experience the flavors
  of Sonoma County at their seasonal peak. The elevated four-course menu sh
 owcases ingredients harvested from Lynmar’s organically farmed gardens\,
  orchards\, and olive groves. Each course is individually plated and thoug
 htfully paired with Lynmar’s acclaimed estate-grown Pinot Noirs\, Chardo
 nnays\, and sparkling wines\, creating a journey that is both deeply conne
 cted to Sonoma County and globally inspired. Served in the idyllic setting
  of Quail Hill Vineyard\, the experience is further enhanced by a special 
 tableside visit from Estate Chef David Frakes.\n\nCollectors Lunch Pairing
  Menu Summer 2026:\n\nAdam’s Vineyard Chardonnay\, 2022\n\nWarm Organic 
 Popcorn\n\nWhite Corn-Kasundi Salt\, Estate Extra-Virgin Olive Oil\n\nSusa
 nna’s Vineyard Chardonnay\, 2022\n\nThai Green Curry & Coconut Soup\n\nB
 liss Snap Peas & Heirloom Radish\n\nYoung Vines Pinot Noir\, 2021\n\nHeirl
 oom Potato & Cherry Tomato ‘Croustade’\n\nSmoked Bacon-Grain Mustard D
 ressing\n\nSusanna’s Vineyard Pinot Noir\, 2022\n\nRoasted Syrian Seven-
 Spiced Chicken Breast\n\nIndonesian Corn Fritter\, Summer Vegetable Ragout
 \, Balado Sauce\n\nRosé de Blancs Sparkling\, 2021\n\nChilled Vanilla Bur
 nt Basque Cheesecake\n\nRaspberry-Rose Syrup\, Black Tea & Licorice-Poache
 d Cherries\n\nBrown Butter Nilla Cookie\, Candied Lime\n\nEstate Ingredien
 ts:\n\nBay Laurel\, Cherries\, Chives\, Edible Flowers\, Lemons\, Olive Oi
 l\, Peas\, Potatoes\, Radishes\, Raspberries\, Thyme\, Tomatoes\, Zucchini
  and more!\n\nMenu by Estate Chef David Frakes\n\nReservations are require
 d. Maximum group size is six guests.
LOCATION:Lynmar Estate
URL:https://lynmarestate.com/reservation/type/collectors-lunch-pairing/ 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bongs + Books Silent Book Club at The Lounge at Mercy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T200000
UID:260625S3FJ0NhJDk2P9SX7YdQX0Q
DESCRIPTION:Because sometimes the best kind of community… is quiet.🌿
 📖\n\nNo assigned books\, no deadlines\, no discussions you have to part
 icipate in — just a shared space to unwind\, light up\, and get lost in 
 a good read. Bring whatever you’re currently reading \\(or listening to 
 - we have coloring books and puzzles for our audiobook lovers!\\)\, grab s
 omething to smoke\, and settle in for a cozy night of uninterrupted readin
 g alongside fellow book lovers.\n\nCome solo or with friends and enjoy com
 fy vibes\, good weed\, and a room full of people happily minding their own
  business.\n\nHow it works:\n\n5-6pm: Arrive\, get settled\, and kick thin
 gs off with a short welcome sesh.\n\n6-7pm: Uninterrupted reading time\, l
 o-fi music\, and chill energy.\n\n7-8pm: wrap up chapters\, meet other rea
 ders\, one last sesh to end the evening!
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://bookclubs.com/bongs-books-silent-book-club/join/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
