 nd the Sinfonie Concertante for violin and viola. Performed on the Fountai
 n Court\, the concert features acclaimed soloists Robin Hansen \\(violin\\
 ) and Elizabeth Prior \\(viola\\)\, under the direction of guest conductor
  Ryan Murray. Guests can choose from table or festival seating and enjoy a
  relaxed wine country atmosphere. Food from Lasagna Con Amore will be avai
 lable for purchase\, and picnic tables are open for early dining before th
 e performance. Wine will also be available for purchase from the tasting r
 oom. Bring friends and family for a memorable evening of world-class music
 \, delicious food\, and beautiful outdoor surroundings.
