SUMMARY:Ceramic Carving - Vases
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T130000
UID:260401mpWl8PAyIkCd593IViQkqw
DESCRIPTION:Join Kelly from No Peach Ceramics for a hands-on ceramic carvi
 ng class. \n\nSgraffito is an ancient technique of surface decoration tha
 t involves scratching or carving through a layer to reveal a contrasting c
 olor beneath. \n\n During the course of this 3 hour workshop\, we will c
 over the fundamentals of which tools and techniques to best to apply \\(an
 d then remove\\) slips and underglazes to a pre-prepared clay "canvas". De
 monstrations of when and how to carve successfully will be supplemented wi
 th in-depth advice on each aspect of the sgraffito process. \n\n All exp
 erience levels are welcome! You will be provided with materials\, tools\, 
 and forms to practice sgraffito and make your own unique platter. Bringing
  inspiration photos and design ideas is welcomed and encouraged! We will b
 e providing one pre-prepared raw clay platter per student to use during th
 e course. After the class\, we will fire your finished piece and it will b
 e ready for pick up within 2-3 weeks.
LOCATION:Art Escape
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/ceramic-carving-vases/1
 8486181/2026-07-25T10
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
