 ating\, honoring\, and sharing sacred spiritual music in many exciting for
 ms. Join us for a nourishing and uplifting combination of transformative m
 usic in our Great Hall\, an optional bring-your-own picnic outside in natu
 re\, and an opportunity to gather with saṅgha on our stunning Spirit Roc
 k land. Gates will open two hours before the performance.\n\nGuided Medita
 tion. Crystal Bowl Soundbath. LoFi Hip Hop. Treat yourself to an immersive
  evening of musical meditation with Born I (aka Ofosu Jones-Quartey)\, a m
 editation teacher\, hip-hop artist\, and author from the Washington DC are
