BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tuesdays in the Plaza: Playing the Dead (Grateful Dead Tribute)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260728T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260728T200000
UID:26060508NlfdFYb0SetDqAJ3p4Pw
DESCRIPTION:Our weekly summer concerts in the Healdsburg Plaza from 6:00 p
 .m. to 8:00 p.m. provide an eclectic and unique line-up of bands\, and hav
 e been assembled to please a wide array of musical interests. Food vendors
  will be on-hand to offer locally sourced food for sale starting at 5:00 p
 .m. with the music beginning at 6:00 p.m.\n\nAbout the band: Rooted in the
  heart of San Francisco’s storied musical landscape\, Playing the Dead i
 s more than just a tribute band—they are a living\, breathing homage to 
 the spirit of the Grateful Dead and jerry garcia. Fusing improvisation\, p
 sychedelic textures\, and heartfelt musicianship\, the band captures the e
 ssence of The Dead's legendary live shows while adding their own unique sp
 ark to every performance.\n\nFormed by a collective of Bay Area musicians 
 with deep reverence for The Dead’s catalog and countercultural ethos\, P
 laying The Dead has quickly gained a loyal following throughout Northern C
 alifornia. Their shows are journeys—equal parts celebration and ceremony
 —where long-time Deadheads and new listeners alike gather to dance\, con
 nect\, and relive the magic.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Plaza
URL:https://healdsburg.gov/335/Tuesdays-in-the-Plaza
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
