 nd an evening of music and adventure. July 30 – Controllers & Karaoke Ch
 allenge your friends in the video game truck\, sing your favorite songs du
 ring karaoke\, and dance the night away. What to Expect Rotating lineup of
  local food trucks Live DJ and music Interactive games and attractions ‍
  ‍ ‍ Family-friendly activities/facepainter  A fun\, safe\, and welcom
 ing atmosphere Special Thanks Bite Night Thursdays are made possible throu
 gh the support of the City of Vallejo and Measure P\, helping provide free
