BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Keys to Health\, Peace\, and Freedom - A Presentation by Dr Wi
 ll Tuttle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T150000
UID:260709skHypUh7fUiKMehQHl0W-Q
DESCRIPTION:Are you concerned about the quality of food available today?\n
 \nAre you troubled by the high rates of chronic disease in our society?\n\
 nWould you like to understand the hidden roots of the dilemmas we face as 
 individuals and a society\, and to learn new skills for healthier\, more s
 ustainable living?\n\nAre you interested in practical keys to radiant heal
 th?\n\nAuthor of international best-seller\, The World Peace Diet\, as wel
 l as the companion books The World Peace Way and Food for Freedom\, Dr. Wi
 ll Tuttle delivers an inspiring talk about our culture’s food systems an
 d shares his wisdom regarding practical tools to reduce our environmental 
 footprint\, make healthy lifestyle choices\, and improve our relationships
 \, with one another and the world. Dr. Tuttle and his spouse Madeleine wil
 l guide us toward building radiant health\, optimizing our wellness and jo
 y\, and building a positive future for all. DIscover the knowledge for sel
 f-healing\, physically\, socially\, culturally\, psychologically\, and spi
 ritually!\n\nQ & A session and discussion to follow. Don't miss the chance
  to get your signed copies of The World Peace Diet and The World Peace Way
  - books will be for sale with the author available for signing.\n\nDr Wil
 l Tuttle\, visionary educator\, musician\, and author of the international
  best-seller\, The World Peace Diet\, published in 16 languages\, has lect
 ured and performed in over 50 countries. A featured expert in Cowspiracy a
 nd other documentary films\, he’s a recipient of the prestigious Courage
  of Conscience Award. A former Zen monk and Dharma Master in the Zen tradi
 tion\, he is the author of several books and has created 10 much-loved CD 
 albums of original piano music. His inspiring presentations often include 
 his music as well as evocative animal and nature paintings by his spouse\,
  Madeleine\, visionary artist from Switzerland\, who is also a flutist\, W
 aldorf teacher\, organic gardener\, and vegan chef. Visit www.worldpeaced
 iet.com to learn more about their work.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/616129/the-
 keys-to-health-peace-and-freedom-a-presentation-by-dr-will-tuttle
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Park Rx—Beginner Hiking for Fitness
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T130000
UID:260701LnMxe6swlkiFiFuYupK2fQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us on this fitness program\, where the leaders w
 ill guide you on a series of 8 weekly hikes with the challenge
  increasing each week. Before the first hike\, the leader will 
 discuss proper shoes\, hydration\, incorporating hiking poles\, pro
 per pacing\, etc. The group's final hike aims for the long rout
 e up Brushy Peaks Trail\, where hikers can enjoy the beautiful 
 vistas.\n\nThe following is a list of possible routes selected fo
 r this hiking series: 1) Sat 8/1 - White Barn to Uranus\, 2.1 
 miles\, 180 ft elev \\[meet @ white barn\\] 2) Sat 8/8 - Meadow
 - Hillside loop\, 3 miles\, 490 ft elev \\[meet @ white barn\\]
