 s are pushing the boundaries of metalwork while honoring its deep craft tr
 aditions\, illuminating how these works carry both personal and collective
  histories.\n\nModerator: David Duskin    \n\nParticipating Artists: Micha
 el McGinnis\, Martin Munson\, James Ford Grant\, Ray Degischer\, Byron B. 
 Kim\n\n 
