 d amazing musicianship create lasting\, memorable moments. \n\nEach member
  of Mars Hotel is a lifelong fan of the Grateful Dead and each has a perso
 nal connection to the band's music. For a few\, the Dead's music was passe
 d down from an older sibling\, while others can recount personal stories o
 f following the band on the road. \n\nThe members of Mars Hotel revel in t
 he Grateful Dead's story\, the band members' personalities and their incre
 dible musicianship. \n\nThat's probably why audience members say that Mars
