UID:260709NmHUVXxoL0SEbHEoYhVPuA
DESCRIPTION:✨ Experience an unforgettable evening with Michelle Lambert 
 at Live at Juilliard! Join us on Sunday\, August 2\, from 5–7 p.m. in hi
 storic Juilliard Park for a free\, family-friendly concert featuring one o
 f the Bay Area’s most exciting rising artists. Michelle Lambert is a bre
 akout pop singer-songwriter known for her powerful vocals\, captivating so
 ngwriting\, and electrifying stage presence. Michelle has topped the chart
 s on Indie Radio with her original music and was featured in the San Franc
 isco Giants' City Connect Campaign as a standout Bay Area artist. After ho
 ning her craft in the highly competitive music scenes of Nashville and Los
  Angeles\, she has developed a dynamic sound and live show that captivates
  audiences from the very first note. Whether she's delivering soaring pop 
 anthems or heartfelt originals\, Michelle brings energy\, talent\, and aut
 henticity to every performance. Learn more: www.michellelambert.com Enjoy 
 local beer and wine while supporting the Kiwanis Club Santa Rosa  Come hun
 gry! Grab dinner from Costas Tacos and Citas Kitchen  Grab a treat with So
 noma Churros  Bring your lawn chairs\, blankets\, family\, and friends for
  an evening of incredible live music\, delicious food\, and summer fun in 
 the heart of Santa Rosa. The 31st Annual Live at Juilliard Concert Series 
 offers free concerts every Sunday from 5–7 p.m. in Juilliard Park. Learn
  more: www.srcity.org/arts
LOCATION:Juilliard Park
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1036337409070260/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
