DESCRIPTION:Live music 11 am – 1 pm\n\nWelcome your Sunday at Priest Ran
 ch! Sunday Sessions features live acoustic music\, brunch-themed small bit
 es from The Kitchen at Priest Ranch\, and a curated flight of brunch-frien
 dly wines. As always\, enjoy the option of wines by the glass or bottle\, 
 if preferred. Come as you are and settle into an easygoing Sunday with gre
 at wine\, food\, and music.\n\n$15 deposit/person to be credited towards b
 everage purchase\n\nReservations are recommended\, walk-ins welcome.
